<LegalPage title="Contact Us" description="Contact the 5 Letter Words team with questions, feedback or word-list corrections.">
  <p>We read every message. Email us at <a href="mailto:contact@5letter-words.io">contact@5letter-words.io</a> and we will reply as soon as we can.</p>
  <h2>What to include</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>The page address you were using.</li>
    <li>What you expected and what happened instead.</li>
    <li>For word-list issues, the word and the game or dictionary you were checking.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>For copyright concerns, please use the process on our <a href="/dmca">DMCA page</a>.</p>
</LegalPage>
